 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Jacob lay down with a stone for his pillow",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 6.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In the wilderness alone",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 6.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And he dreamed of a ladder set upon the earth",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 5.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Its top reaching up to the throne",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 4.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Angels going up and down, going up and down",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Surely the Lord is in this place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And I did not know it",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Angels going up and down",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Lord stood above and said to him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 6.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I am with you wherever you go",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 6.05,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I will not leave you until I have done",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 5.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "All the things I have promised you so",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.4,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Angels going up and down, going up and down",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Surely the Lord is in this place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 7.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And I did not know it",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 7.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He is in this place, and I did not know He was there",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 10.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the house of God, this is the gate of heaven",
   "heard": 12,
